41
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're almost at
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

42
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is everybody here?</font>

43
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, sir!
— Yes, sir!</font>

44
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother Omasa,
we're missing one!</font>

45
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Who is it?!</font>

46
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Idate! Morino Idate!</font>

47
00:01:58,550 --> 00:02:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn, he's such a hopeless kid!</font>

48
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?
Shall we wait?</font>

49
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have no choice...</font>

50
00:02:05,930 --> 00:02:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

51
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?!</font>

52
00:02:09,810 --> 00:02:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You people are from the Wasabi Family
of the Land of Tea, correct?</font>

53
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you!</font>

54
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should know your place.</font>

55
00:02:21,570 --> 00:02:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hooligans like you people
are no match for a Shinobi!</font>

56
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't worry.
I won't take your lives.</font>

57
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've learned from this,</font>

58
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should give up the race
at Todoroki Great Shrine.</font>

59
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast it!</font>

60
00:02:57,940 --> 00:03:01,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to at least deliver this letter
to the Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

61
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">OK! Mission! Mission!
I'm so eager to do it!</font>

62
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Kakashi-sensei is not here.</font>

63
00:03:31,770 --> 00:03:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he late as usual?</font>

64
00:03:34,270 --> 00:03:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, Kakashi will not be coming.</font>

65
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Grandma Tsunade!</font>

66
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't call me an old lady!</font>

67
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me... Hokage-sama...</font>

68
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by
Kakashi-sensei will not be coming?</font>

69
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you three already know,</font>

70
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">most of the Jonin including Kakashi
are on different missions.</font>

71
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, the three of you will have
to execute the mission by yourselves.</font>

72
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a B-rank mission,
escorting an important figure!</font>

73
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Escorting an important figure...</font>

74
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course,
depending on the situation,</font>

75
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the mission has the possibility
of becoming an A-rank.</font>

76
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:16,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, who are we protecting?</font>

77
00:04:17,150 --> 00:04:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't know...</font>

78
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean
"don't know"?!</font>

79
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the neighbouring nation
of the Land of Tea,</font>

80
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they have a Dedication Ceremony
at the Todoroki Great Shrine</font>

81
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">once every four years.</font>

82
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've received a request
to escort the runner</font>

83
00:04:28,370 --> 00:04:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who will be participating in
the race that will be held there.</font>

84
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But an assailant from the opponent's side</font>

85
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">attacked the messengers
before they arrived here.</font>

86
00:04:39,590 --> 00:04:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assailant?</font>

87
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me, but I still don't
quite understand the mission.</font>

88
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you should get the details
directly from Boss Jirocho.</font>

89
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss Jirocho?! Oh yeah!
The boss from that time!</font>

90
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it.</font>

91
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you three understand,
depart immediately!</font>

92
00:04:58,650 --> 00:05:01,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get to the Land of Tea by today.
Snap to it!</font>

93
00:05:01,570 --> 00:05:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— All right.
Okay!</font>

94
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger that!</font>

95
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you.</font>

96
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:16,330
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Come Now,</font>

97
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:16,330
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">New Mission</font>

98
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:16,330
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Save the Obligation,</font>

99
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:16,330
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Sympathy and the</font>

100
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:16,330
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Country of Tea!</font>

101
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Sakura, aren't you hungry?</font>

102
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, a little bit...</font>

103
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it's decided!</font>

104
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And perfect timing!
There's a tea-house right over there!</font>

105
00:05:33,890 --> 00:05:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto.</font>

106
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're here...?</font>

107
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rokusho Aoi has now arrived.</font>

108
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had you go through
all that trouble,</font>

109
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but Jirocho of the Wasabi
does not know when to give up.</font>

110
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he still trying to take part
in the race at Todoroki Great Shrine?</font>

111
00:05:59,670 --> 00:06:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

112
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's new information
that they have also hired Shinobi.</font>

113
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

114
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:12,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then next time, let's beat them
to a pulp at the race...</font>

115
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

116
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ma'am, I'll have sweet bean soup.</font>

117
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll have dumplings.</font>

118
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about you, Sasuke?</font>

119
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jelly...</font>

120
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, please wait for a moment.</font>

121
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja from the Leaf...</font>

122
00:06:36,370 --> 00:06:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna work so hard!</font>

123
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, don't take unnecessary action
by yourself.</font>

124
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:42,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, okay.</font>

125
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:46,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having sweet bean soup
when it's so nice outside.</font>

126
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja profession sure
is carefree!</font>

127
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

128
00:06:52,350 --> 00:06:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things must really be peaceful
for the Leaf Village.</font>

129
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a dense-looking
bunch of guys...</font>

130
00:06:58,850 --> 00:06:59,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

131
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I didn't know there was
such a cutie here.</font>

132
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I take back that previous comment!</font>

133
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah... pardon me.</font>

134
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Idate Morino.</font>

135
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your name, young lady?</font>

136
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you talk to Sakura
in such a familiar tone!</font>

137
00:07:14,990 --> 00:07:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura... That's a good name.</font>

138
00:07:18,450 --> 00:07:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, even a chance meeting is due
to karma from a previous life.</font>

139
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we talk about our future?</font>

140
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:28,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Talk about... the future?</font>

141
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm talking about you quitting
the Ninja life and becoming my bride...</font>

142
00:07:33,470 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you! How dare you
hit on her all of a sudden!</font>

143
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:37,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be silly!</font>

144
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just joking.</font>

145
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But hey, you fool!</font>

146
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate here hates Ninja!</font>

147
00:07:46,570 --> 00:07:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wander around
the Land of Tea anymore,</font>

148
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there'll be a price to pay!</font>

149
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's amusing! Bring it on!</font>

150
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

151
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ridiculous! We don't have time
to waste on a hooligan.</font>

152
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet, Sasuke!</font>

153
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to forgive a guy
who makes fun of Shinobi!</font>

154
00:08:07,590 --> 00:08:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to punish this guy...</font>

155
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

156
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gone...</font>

157
00:08:13,130 --> 00:08:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impossible!
I didn't even notice...</font>

158
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did that guy run away to?!</font>

159
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, thank you for waiting.</font>

160
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dang it!</font>

161
00:08:25,270 --> 00:08:26,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for your patronage.</font>

162
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Two bills?</font>

163
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...?</font>

164
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that kid who was here left,
saying that you guys would pay.</font>

165
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy!
How dare he make fools of us!</font>

166
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sound of footsteps is far off...
He has considerable speed!</font>

167
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He made us look like idiots!</font>

168
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:48,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stay quiet.
We have to chase him!</font>

169
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missus, thank you very much.
I'll leave the money here.</font>

170
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks!</font>

171
00:08:57,010 --> 00:08:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All the customers today
seem to be in such a hurry.</font>

172
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has incredible speed.
He must have trained very hard.</font>

173
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is he?</font>

174
00:09:06,650 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't matter, we're definitely
going to catch up to him!</font>

175
00:09:12,690 --> 00:09:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid Ninja!</font>

176
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way
they can catch up to me!</font>

177
00:09:30,170 --> 00:09:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Owww!</font>

178
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn it... Swift Runner Idate
makes a mistake of a lifetime!</font>

179
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Serves you right!</font>

180
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:48,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have some nerve,
trying to run away from us.</font>

181
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so sorry!</font>

182
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

183
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

184
00:09:54,990 --> 00:09:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had my wallet stolen and was at a loss,
then you guys showed up.</font>

185
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I did that...</font>

186
00:10:03,990 --> 00:10:06,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You kinda feel sorry
after hearing his story.</font>

187
00:10:06,370 --> 00:10:09,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you should have said that
from the start!</font>

188
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow! Huh...?</font>

189
00:10:12,590 --> 00:10:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

190
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't touch it!</font>

191
00:10:18,090 --> 00:10:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is mine!</font>

192
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the...?!</font>

193
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On your mark.</font>

194
00:10:26,730 --> 00:10:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get set...</font>

195
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

196
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weights?</font>

197
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try to catch me now, you idiots!</font>

198
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! He escaped again!</font>

199
00:10:37,070 --> 00:10:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy!</font>

200
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He simply doesn't get it!</font>

201
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he for real?</font>

202
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What speed...!</font>

203
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!
Even we can't catch up to him...?</font>

204
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it. We don't have a chance
of catching up.</font>

205
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:05,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dang it! He'll get it
when I see him next time!</font>

206
00:11:11,350 --> 00:11:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of you, thanks for coming.</font>

207
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begging your pardon!
Begging your pardon!</font>

208
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was born and raised
in the Leaf Village in the Land of Fire.</font>

209
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was bathed in birth water
at "Ichiraku Ramen."</font>

210
00:11:24,830 --> 00:11:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My given name is Naruto
and the surname is Uzumaki.</font>

211
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People call me...</font>

212
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Loser!</font>

213
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Loser...? Nah, not that!</font>

214
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're funny as usual.</font>

215
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss Jirocho,
you're looking good yourself.</font>

216
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

217
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's okay.
A boy should be this spunky.</font>

218
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The greetings seem to be done,
so I'll get to the main topic.</font>

219
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage told us to get
the details of this mission from you.</font>

220
00:11:55,730 --> 00:11:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, in fact...</font>

221
00:12:00,570 --> 00:12:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know of the Dedication Ceremony
at the Todoroki Great Shrine?</font>

222
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To... Todo... what?</font>

223
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, make yourselves comfortable.</font>

224
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:15,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The legend goes...</font>

225
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago,
in order to subdue a storm,</font>

226
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ryuko's Jewels were dedicated
to the Todoroki Great Shrine</font>

227
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the storm subsided.</font>

228
00:12:30,060 --> 00:12:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It became a customary event
that happens once every four years.</font>

229
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:38,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At first, it was just to dedicate the
jewels, but several decades ago,</font>

230
00:12:38,690 --> 00:12:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it became a festival in which
the first-place runner</font>

231
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:42,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">became the man of the year.</font>

232
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In recent years, the festival has
taken on another face.</font>

233
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For ages now,
in this port town of Degarashi,</font>

234
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:57,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">two families,
the Wasabi and the Wagarashi,</font>

235
00:12:57,130 --> 00:12:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have controlled local operations
and policed the town.</font>

236
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's embarrassing,</font>

237
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:05,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but conflict between the two families
has never ceased and</font>

238
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there have been numerous skirmishes
over territorial rights.</font>

239
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the struggle intensified,</font>

240
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the town residents became entangled
and even got injured...</font>

241
00:13:18,610 --> 00:13:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to put a stop to the conflict,
for the first time,</font>

242
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there was talk of some kind of mediation
in the presence of the lord.</font>

243
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:30,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it was agreed that the power holder
of the town</font>

244
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be determined in a contest
rather than through brawls.</font>

245
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:36,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that contest is...</font>

246
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is the Todoroki Great Shrine
Dedication Ceremony</font>

247
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that is held every four years.</font>

248
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Four years ago, the Wagarashi
easily won by hiring a Shinobi,</font>

249
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we have learned that
they've hired a Shinobi again this year.</font>

250
00:13:51,810 --> 00:13:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to counteract that,</font>

251
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we sent messengers to
the Hidden Leaf Village with a request,</font>

252
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they were ambushed and attacked.</font>

253
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you guys!</font>

254
00:14:12,830 --> 00:14:14,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please lend us your power.</font>

255
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We cannot afford to lose this race
to the Wagarashi Family!</font>

256
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

257
00:14:23,710 --> 00:14:25,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, who do you want us
to escort?</font>

258
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:28,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, so you'll take this job?</font>

259
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you call for me, Boss?</font>

260
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:46,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you guys know each other?
Then that makes the story fast.</font>

261
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might not actually
be the case...</font>

262
00:14:54,950 --> 00:14:57,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss Jirocho is an important person!</font>

263
00:14:57,750 --> 00:15:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By rights, he shouldn't bow
his head to Ninja like you!</font>

264
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if he did bow his head,
I'd flatly refuse to escort a guy like you.</font>

265
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah?!</font>

266
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As if I'd go with some guy who came
from who-knows-where!</font>

267
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Some guy from who-knows-where"?!</font>

268
00:15:15,930 --> 00:15:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the brilliant Ninja,
Uzumaki Naruto,</font>

269
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who will eventually inherit
the name of Hokage!</font>

270
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Hokage is no big deal!</font>

271
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! The boss of hooligans
is even less of a big deal!</font>

272
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot! Boss Jirocho is
a very honourable person!</font>

273
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage is a great Shinobi</font>

274
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:35,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who puts his life on the line
to protect the village!</font>

275
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:38,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss Jirocho is a very,
very, very honourable person</font>

276
00:15:38,410 --> 00:15:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who always puts his life
on the line to protect the town!</font>

277
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage is more, more,
more incredible!</font>

278
00:15:58,970 --> 00:16:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it's a tourist resort,
everything seems so expensive.</font>

279
00:16:02,810 --> 00:16:05,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry about that.
It sure is expensive, isn't it?</font>

280
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:06,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no, I didn't mean...</font>

281
00:16:07,110 --> 00:16:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We actually don't want to sell
at this kind of price,</font>

282
00:16:09,780 --> 00:16:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but after the Wagarashi family
came into power...</font>

283
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please forgive me!</font>

284
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you?!</font>

285
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know who you have
to thank to do business?</font>

286
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you actually thinking about turning
against the Wagarashi Family?</font>

287
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Not at all.
But I have to get paid...</font>

288
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:28,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're slow to understand.</font>

289
00:16:28,710 --> 00:16:29,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey!
— Yes, sir!</font>

290
00:16:30,590 --> 00:16:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please stop!</font>

291
00:16:33,260 --> 00:16:35,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! First of all, we'll destroy you...</font>

292
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Who are you?!</font>

293
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:42,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of here before you get hurt!</font>

294
00:16:43,190 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

295
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please run away!</font>

296
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These people are from
the Wagarashi...</font>

297
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be fine.</font>

298
00:16:49,070 --> 00:16:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You punk!
— Wise guy!</font>

299
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll let you go for today!</font>

300
00:16:58,700 --> 00:17:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've learned your lesson,
never defy us again, kid!</font>

301
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or you'll pay when
we see you next time!</font>

302
00:17:10,090 --> 00:17:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Y-You won't get away with this!
— Y-You won't get away with this!</font>

303
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:14,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Young man...</font>

304
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much.</font>

305
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a refreshing feeling!</font>

306
00:17:19,810 --> 00:17:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We definitely need Boss Jirocho's
Wasabi Family to win the upcoming race.</font>

307
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

308
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

309
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

310
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:43,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of all people,
did you have to ask the Leaf Shinobi?</font>

311
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't sulk like that, Idate.</font>

312
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not sulking.</font>

313
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just that...</font>

314
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...</font>

315
00:17:54,670 --> 00:17:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe in you more
than anybody else.</font>

316
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rest depends on you.</font>

317
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you believe
in people a little?</font>

318
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...</font>

319
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">please run for this town.</font>

320
00:18:17,570 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you!</font>

321
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

322
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

323
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even in exchange for my life...</font>

324
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, I didn't think it was going
to be this big!</font>

325
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what kind of race is it?</font>

326
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:47,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain the course so
a dummy like you can understand.</font>

327
00:18:47,850 --> 00:18:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The starting point is Degarashi Port.</font>

328
00:18:50,770 --> 00:18:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the start, you head for
Modoroki Shrine which is the midway point.</font>

329
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Modoroki Shrine...?</font>

330
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... It seems the fastest way
to get to Modoroki Shrine</font>

331
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to use a boat from here.</font>

332
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you take one of two Ryuko's jewels
from Modoroki Shrine and</font>

333
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">dedicate that jewel at the
Todoroki Great Shrine on Ouzu Island.</font>

334
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only rule
for the race.</font>

335
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So shortcuts, obstructions,
and secret maneuvers are all allowed.</font>

336
00:19:18,170 --> 00:19:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So hiring a Ninja is not
a violation of the rule either.</font>

337
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are the Ninja that
the other side hired?</font>

338
00:19:24,890 --> 00:19:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're hiding somewhere
and checking the situation.</font>

339
00:19:27,810 --> 00:19:29,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be careless, Naruto!</font>

340
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:30,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right!</font>

341
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys can just relax and watch.
Don't follow me around!</font>

342
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

343
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying I don't want
an impediment.</font>

344
00:19:38,990 --> 00:19:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

345
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:42,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.
Let's join forces here.</font>

346
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:44,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Not with a guy like this!
— Not with a guy like this!</font>

347
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They seem to strangely be
in harmony, these two.</font>

348
00:19:49,290 --> 00:19:50,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, everybody!</font>

349
00:19:50,710 --> 00:19:54,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Todoroki Great Shrine Race
will start soon!</font>

350
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasabi Family's runner,
Idate Morino!</font>

351
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate... Morino?</font>

352
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wagarashi Family's runner,
Fukusuke Hikyakuya!</font>

353
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On your mark!</font>

354
00:20:40,630 --> 00:20:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Start!</font>

355
00:20:43,510 --> 00:20:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! We're going too!</font>

356
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the...?!</font>

357
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he running away?!</font>

358
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going, Idate?!</font>

359
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait!</font>

360
00:20:55,850 --> 00:20:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is he doing...?</font>

361
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

362
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

363
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

364
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

365
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

366
00:21:16,390 --> 00:21:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

367
00:21:16,390 --> 00:21:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

368
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:25,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

369
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:25,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

370
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

371
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

372
00:21:31,770 --> 00:21:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

373
00:21:31,770 --> 00:21:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

374
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

375
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

376
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

377
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

378
00:21:48,630 --> 00:21:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

379
00:21:48,630 --> 00:21:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

380
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

381
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

382
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

383
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

384
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

385
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

386
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

387
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

388
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

389
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

390
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

391
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

392
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck is he thinking?!
That idiot!</font>

393
00:22:41,130 --> 00:22:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So fast. He's moving at
an incredible speed.</font>

394
00:22:44,380 --> 00:22:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn it! The opponent's already
far out at sea!</font>

395
00:22:47,220 --> 00:22:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

396
00:22:47,970 --> 00:22:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the distance between them gets
any greater, it'll be impossible to win!</font>

397
00:22:50,470 --> 00:22:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot!</font>

398
00:22:51,470 --> 00:22:53,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Kick it up a notch, Sakura!
— Right!</font>

399
00:22:53,510 --> 00:22:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna bring him back at all cost
and make up the difference!</font>

400
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time:
"The Race is On! Trouble on the High Seas!"</font>

401
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't miss it!</font>

